  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Bug Fixes\n\n* exclude Linux native assets from NuGet package ([e047caf](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/commit/e047cafe61882b96b9311baf425bf0118e5fee66)), closes [#18](https://github.com/LM-Development/ShinyPDF/issues/18)\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* ShinyPDF now depends on SkiaSharp 4 and HarfBuzzSharp 14.\nOn Linux, consumers must reference SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux and\nHarfBuzzSharp.NativeAssets.Linux themselves, as they are no longer pulled\nin transitively.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
